## Prerequisites

- Access to target environment: `vault login`
- CLI toolchain installed: `<TOOL_NAME>`

## Action Steps

### Step 1 — <Action-oriented subhead — e.g., 'Generate new credential in Vault'>

```bash
export VAULT_ADDR="https://vault.internal:8200"
vault kv put secret/staging/api-keys key="<NEW_API_KEY>"
```

### Step 2 — <Action-oriented subhead — e.g., 'Trigger deployment reload'>

```bash
kubectl rollout restart deployment/<SERVICE_NAME> -n staging
```

## Verify Resolution

<Execute a command to confirm the recipe succeeded.>

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer <NEW_API_KEY>" https://staging.internal/api/v1/ping
```

## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `401 Unauthorized` | New secret has not propagated to pod environment | Wait 30s or check `kubectl get pods` restart status |
| `500 Server Error` | Key format mismatch | Ensure key does not contain unescaped newline characters |

